==Battleground==
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Dragon Rider (Enemy)|Dragon Riders]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A pretty easy stage, all enemies are at low magnification making them easy to deal with. Units such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can help for this stage, any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit]] units you have can deal with the Metal Hippoe.

